# Records summary

The retention period for financial records is five (5) years after the end of the financial year [[cite:obs-d2b4eec7e8eb409bd5b8ee57d9445df0f24898aa "Financial records are retained for five (5) years after the end of the financial year."]].

Backups of the records system are taken weekly and verified by restore [[cite:obs-37e3c76475c309fb4436732d67ef80d0052dffe9 "Backups of the records system are taken weekly and verified by restore."]].
